    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277480/extras/1ac8f0cd54ef0ec9cd51b0d276cc6c21.avif?t=1734670230\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game's theme is &quot;a situational trial&quot;! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by the long anticipated feature of real-time sex scenes, the long awaited 5th release in Blue Arrow Garden's 3D shaded illustration series has arrived!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Who are you again?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Um, well, I was h-hoping I could spend the night... Haha\u2026&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, my reunion with my first love from ten years ago\u2026 And he didn't even notice it was me! In that case\u2026 I'll just have to make him fall for the new me then!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Sheesh... Okay, fine. But only tonight.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Yay! Thank you so much!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He got hungry so I cook him dinner. Of course, a way to a man's heart is through is stomach!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Thanks again for dinner!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;You're very welcome! I'll get everything cleaned up!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When I tried to get up, I tripped over a pile of papers that was on the floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;S-Sorry! Are those photos of women?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Yeah. My parents sent me some match-making photos, but I never actually looked at any of them. I honestly can't imagine myself getting married, and I'm so busy with work that I really have no interest in even entertaining the idea.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To think that I have these many rivals... My heart started to pound loudly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I see... Well, wanna give it a test run?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A test run? Of what? &quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;You know, find out what m-married life is like. Just for a day.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A one night stand suddenly becomes a reunion and thus begins a long night for these two\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the multi-angle camera, there's also a free roam camera that could let you enjoy and find your young wife's lewdest angles! From the ceiling? From outside the house? Inside a closet? A multi-angle lewd experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new system! Tanned skin and tan lines! Choose your preferred tan lines from bikini, micro bikini, and school swimsuit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glasses! There are two types of rims and two types of rimless glasses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blindfolds! Try cloth or leather blindfolds for an interesting experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face masks! You can use non-woven fabric masks, or urethane ones in black or white for the full AV experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not to mention there are also custom costumes such as cat ears or dog ears!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can make her experience ghost sex by adjusting the main character's transparency. Make him half transparent, or completely transparent!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a different experience with the camera filters! You can make it look like you're filming a video, watching a video on a website, taking a video with your phone, or even like a security cam footage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing the game's main story, you unlock the &quot;Park&quot; where you can walk around freely and have outdoor sex any time you want!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277480/extras/a63197653ede40fbcc4624f3a610ffd6.avif?t=1734670230\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277480/extras/9158104efd46c75bf418438bbac86035.avif?t=1734670230\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277480/extras/6acce88f3cb8baa744425a7e6180bc35.avif?t=1734670230\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span> </p>",
