rk that I really have no interest in even entertaining the idea.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To think that I have these many rivals... My heart started to pound loudly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I see... Well, wanna give it a test run?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A test run? Of what? &quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;You know, find out what m-married life is like. Just for a day.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A one night stand suddenly becomes a reunion and thus begins a long night for these two\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the multi-angle camera, there's also a free roam camera that could let you enjoy and find your young wife's lewdest angles! From the ceiling? From outside the house? Inside a closet? A multi-angle lewd experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new system! Tanned skin and tan lines! Choose your preferred tan lines from bikini, micro bikini, and school swimsuit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glasses! There are two types of rims and two types of rimless glasses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blindfolds! Try cloth or leather blindfolds for an interesting experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face masks! You can use non-woven fabric masks, or urethane ones in black or white for the full AV experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not to mention there are also custom costumes such as cat ears or dog ears!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can make her experience ghost sex by adjusting the main character's transparency. Make him half transparent, or completely transparent!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a different experience with the camera filters! You can make it look like you're filming a video, watching a video on a website, taking a video with your phone, or even like a security cam footage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing the game's main story, you unlock the &quot;Park&quot; where you can walk around freely and have outdoor sex any time you want!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277480/extras/a63197653ede40fbcc4624f3a610ffd6.avif?t=1734670230\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277480/extras/9158104efd46c75bf418438bbac86035.avif?t=1734670230\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277480/extras/6acce88f3cb8baa744425a7e6180bc35.avif?t=1734670230\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span> </p>",
